[l_english.defeating_our_enemies_goal_desc]
The times are uncertain and war is inevitable. We must ensure that however that war comes, we end up on the winning side.

[l_english.defeating_our_enemies_goal_name]
Win the War

[l_english.great_offensive_goal_desc]
A great offensive seizing enemy territory should be our first step towards the ultimate conclusion of the war.

[l_english.great_offensive_goal_name]
Carry out a Great Offensive

[l_english.industrial_domination_goal_desc]
Modern warfare is all about production capabilities. Let us ensure that we have the largest industrial capability the world has seen.

[l_english.industrial_domination_goal_name]
Expand Civilian Industry

[l_english.liberate_territory_goal_desc]
The enemy is in possession of our territory. Liberating it should be our first goal.

[l_english.liberate_territory_goal_name]
Liberate our Territory

[l_english.resource_control_goal_desc]
The faction needs to ensure it has the resources it needs to take on any threat in the world

[l_english.resource_control_goal_name]
Secure Strategic Resources

[l_english.strategic_bombing_campaign_goal_desc]
A large-scale strategic bombing campaign will systematically degrade the enemy's industrial capacity, allowing us to wear down their forces.

[l_english.strategic_bombing_campaign_goal_name]
Sustained Strategic Bombing Campaign

[l_english.the_atomic_race_goal_desc]
We need to ensure that our enemies, current or future, do not gain access to nuclear weapons before we do. Only by being the first we can be sure that no other power can stand against us.

[l_english.the_atomic_race_goal_name]
Build the First Atomic Bomb

[l_simp_chinese.defeating_our_enemies_goal_desc]
世界风云变幻，战争一触即发。我们必须确保无论这场战争以何种形式爆发，我们终将立于不败之地。

[l_simp_chinese.defeating_our_enemies_goal_name]
赢得战争

[l_simp_chinese.great_offensive_goal_desc]
发起一场夺取敌方领土的大规模攻势，应是我们迈向战争最终胜利的第一步。

[l_simp_chinese.great_offensive_goal_name]
发动大规模攻势

[l_simp_chinese.industrial_domination_goal_desc]
现代战争归根结底是生产能力的较量。我们必须确保拥有全世界前所未见的强大工业实力。

[l_simp_chinese.industrial_domination_goal_name]
扩建民用工业

[l_simp_chinese.liberate_territory_goal_desc]
敌人占领了我们的领土。解放它应是我们的首要目标。

[l_simp_chinese.liberate_territory_goal_name]
解放国土

[l_simp_chinese.resource_control_goal_desc]
阵营需要确保自己拥有应对世界上任何威胁所需的资源

[l_simp_chinese.resource_control_goal_name]
确保战略资源

[l_simp_chinese.strategic_bombing_campaign_goal_desc]
大规模的战略轰炸行动将系统性削弱敌人的工业产能，使我们能够逐步消耗其军队力量。

[l_simp_chinese.strategic_bombing_campaign_goal_name]
持续战略轰炸战役

[l_simp_chinese.the_atomic_race_goal_desc]
必须确保敌对势力无论现在还是未来，均无法先于我方获得核武器。唯有先发制人，方能保证无人能抗衡。

[l_simp_chinese.the_atomic_race_goal_name]
制造第一颗原子弹
